<ul class="pick-specs"><li>5 latex mini bands</li><li>Extra light to extra heavy</li><li>Carry bag</li></ul>
<p><strong>Why it's here:</strong> The most popular mini-band set there is, and for good reason. Five resistances cost about as much as a sports drink, and they cover every warm-up drill an athlete needs.</p><p><strong>Who it's for:</strong> Every athlete. Keep a set in your gym bag for lateral walks and glute bridges before you sprint or jump.</p><p><strong>Watch out for:</strong> Thin latex mini bands can roll up on your thighs and eventually tear. Treat them as a cheap, replaceable item.</p>
