<p><strong>Why it's here:</strong> These are the mini bands you'll find in a lot of performance facilities and team weight rooms. They're thicker and hold up to daily use better than bargain sets.</p><p><strong>Who it's for:</strong> Athletes who warm up with bands every day, and coaches buying for a group.</p><p><strong>Watch out for:</strong> They cost a little more and come in fewer resistance options than the cheapest sets.</p>
